# Frontend (Deno / Fresh)

## Tooling

- Deno config: repo root `deno.json`; VS Code/Cursor: `.vscode/settings.json` enables Deno for `frontend/`.
- After adding routes or islands, ensure `frontend/fresh.gen.ts` matches actual files (admin route tests read this manifest).

## Admin API

- Admin dispatch helpers live in `frontend/api/adminApi.ts`.
- UX terms and route cards: `frontend/content/adminGuides.ts`, `adminUxTerms.ts`.

## Tests

```bash
deno test frontend/tests/<name>.test.ts --allow-read
```

Match CI slices in `.agent/tests/check-runtime-semantics.sh` when touching admin API or search/pipeline semantics.
